        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions DLW1RDDFBR/BST03R, Elegant Offset Door Pull with Rosettes</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Offset Delaware Door Pull features beautiful detailing both on the pull and on the rosettes that come with it. This front door handle is available in 18 inch or 24 inch lengths and can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted. Choose from a wide array of finishes including polished brass and satin nickel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions DLW1RDDFBR/BST03R Offset Delaware Door Pull with Boston Rosettes:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-DLW02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262217\"><b>First Impressions DLW1RDDFBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>DLW1018RDDFBR/BST03R:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 15-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<b>DLW1024RDDFBR/BST03R:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 21-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
